  "qualifications": [
    "While page-scaled, WebKit keeps the layout viewport at the document origin: offsetLeft/offsetTop equal pageLeft/pageTop (Chromium 0/0 after scrollTo(100, 50), 15/20 after the wheel pan).",
    "A WebKit window scroll at page scale 2 also fires the visual viewport scroll, which Chromium does not.",
    "The page scale and obscured insets are host inputs: the browser provider reports both Unsupported. Obscured insets are native-only.",
